  "code" : "public void sortStack(Deque<Integer> stack) {\n    if (stack.isEmpty()) {\n        return;\n    }\n    int top = stack.pop();\n    sortStack(stack);\n    insertSorted(stack, top);\n}\n\nprivate void insertSorted(Deque<Integer> stack, int val) {\n    if (stack.isEmpty() || stack.peek() <= val) {\n        stack.push(val);\n        return;\n    }\n    int top = stack.pop();\n    insertSorted(stack, val);\n    stack.push(top);\n}",
